# No co-author

Every commit has one author: Planexi Global Consult. Nobody else is listed.

Never add any of the following to commits or pull requests:

- Any `Co-authored-by:` line, from Cursor or from any other person or tool
- `Made-with: Cursor` or any other attribution trailer
- `--trailer` / `--footer` flags
- `--signoff` / `Signed-off-by:` if it names anyone else

Use plain `git commit --author="Planexi Global Consult <264581512+planexiglobalconsult@users.noreply.github.com>" -m "..."`. If a hook or tool injects a co-author, strip it and remake the commit before pushing.
